&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Additional are provided for tiny tank connoisseurs. Furthermore, you will be glad to find our turret hatches completely operational (saber wielding psychopath not included).
